        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock 6170, Round Ball Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired, the DoralLock Round Knob is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this ball knob is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it. It is available in dummy, passage, privacy, or keyed entry functions. The keyed entry function features a 5-pin cylinder and meets ANSI A 156.2 grade 2 cylindrical lock standards. All functions are available in 7 finishes. Designed to be easy to install, especially on pre-drilled doors with 2-1/8 inch holes, this knobset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of DoralLock Ball Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install, this knob fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function is ANSI rated grade 2 security.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function is 5 pin Kwikset compatible keyway.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Round Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-6170-specifications.pdf?v=1704262175\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock 6170 Round Knob Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.  Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a finger turn located in the middle of the knob. In an emergency, it can unlock from the exterior using a coin or a screwdriver. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a finger turn on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ball Knob, DoralLock 6170",
                "description": "DoralLock 6170, Round Ball Knob - Designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired, the DoralLock Round Knob is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this ball knob is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it. It is available in dummy, passage, privacy, or keyed entry functions. The keyed entry function features a 5-pin cylinder and meets ANSI A 156.2 grade 2 cylindrical lock standards. All functions are available in 7 finishes. Designed to be easy to install, especially on pre-drilled doors with 2-1/8 inch holes, this knobset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
